{"body": "Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law GWE.2.1.010 Policy Declaration [Repealed] Repealed. ( Res. No. 2024-94 ; Res. No. 2023-129 ; Res. No. 2023-125 .)", "num": "GWE.2.1.010", "path": "library|Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law|GWE|GWE.2|GWE.2.1|GWE.2.1.010", "title": "GWE.2.1.010 Policy Declaration\n[Repealed]", "url": "/us/nsn/lco/council/code/GWE.2.1.010"}
