ntertribal Task Force on October 7, 2010. Section CSV.2.11.070 was amended by the Stipulation for Technical, Management, and Other Updates: Second Amendment of Stipulations Incorporated in the Final Judgment and was adopted by the Voigt Intertribal Task Force on October 7, 2010. Section CSV.2.11.060 was amended by the Stipulation for Technical, Management, and Other Updates: Second Amendment of Stipulations Incorporated in the Final Judgment and was adopted by the Voigt Intertribal Task Force on October 7, 2010. Section CSV.2.11.050 was amended by the Stipulation for Technical, Management, and Other Updates: Second Amendment of Stipulations Incorporated in the Final Judgment and was adopted by the Voigt Intertribal Task Force on October 7, 2010. Section CSV.2.11.040 was amended by the Stipulation for Technical, Management, and Other Updates: Second Amendment of Stipulations Incorporated in the Final Judgment and was adopted by the Voigt Intertribal Task Force on October 7, 2010. Section CSV.2.11.030 was amended by the Stipulation for Technical, Management, and Other Updates: Second Amendment of Stipulations Incorporated in the Final Judgment and was adopted by the Voigt Intertribal Task Force on October 7, 2010. Section CSV.2.11.020 was amended by the Stipulation for Technical, Management, and Other Updates: Second Amendment of Stipulations Incorporated in the Final Judgment and was adopted by the Voigt Intertribal Task Force on October 7, 2010. Section CSV.2.11.010 was amended by the Stipulation for Technical, Management, and Other Updates: Second Amendment of Stipulations Incorporated in the Final Judgment and was adopted by the Voigt Intertribal Task Force on October 7, 2010. This version of the code was originally adopted on pursuant to Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Governing Board Resolution No. 90-62 on September 4, 1990.", "num": "CSV.2.11", "path": "library|Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law|CSV|CSV.2|CSV.2.11", "title": "Subchapter CSV.2.11 [Open]", "url": "/us/nsn/lco/council/code/CSV.2.11"}
