{"body": "Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law CSV.2.13.060 Nests and Eggs (a) No member shall harvest, take, needlessly destroy or possess the nest or eggs of any wild bird for which a closed season is established by this ordinance unless the member possesses a valid permit issued by the tribal conservation department which authorizes the activity in question. (b) In issuing a permit pursuant to this section , the tribal conservation department may impose such conditions and requirements as it deems appropriate or necessary. Prior Codifications \u00a7CSV.2.13.060 was formerly codified as VI LCOTCL \u00a72.1306", "num": "CSV.2.13.060", "path": "library|Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law|CSV|CSV.2|CSV.2.13|CSV.2.13.060", "title": "CSV.2.13.060 Nests and Eggs", "url": "/us/nsn/lco/council/code/CSV.2.13.060"}
