{"body": "Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law PRP.7.3.040 Miscellaneous [Repealed] Repealed. ( Res. No. 2023-19 ; Res. No. 18-71 ; Res. No. 17-46 ; Res. No. 15-95 .) Prior Codifications \u00a7PRP.7.3.040 was formerly codified as XI LCOTCL \u00a77.304", "num": "PRP.7.3.040", "path": "library|Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law|PRP|PRP.7|PRP.7.3|PRP.7.3.040", "title": "PRP.7.3.040 Miscellaneous\n[Repealed]", "url": "/us/nsn/lco/council/code/PRP.7.3.040"}
