{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/lco/council/code/PAP.10.6.170", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law PAP.10.6.170 Internal Audit and Self-Monitoring [Repealed] Repealed. ( Res. No. 2024-27 ; Res. No. 17-41 .) Prior Codifications \u00a7PAP.10.6.170 was formerly codified as XIV LCOTCL \u00a710.617", "num": "PAP.10.6.170", "path": "library|Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law|PAP|PAP.10|PAP.10.6|PAP.10.6.170", "title": "PAP.10.6.170 Internal Audit and Self-Monitoring\n[Repealed]", "url": "/us/nsn/lco/council/code/PAP.10.6.170"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/lco/council/code/PAP.10.6.180", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law PAP.10.6.180 Memorandums of Understanding [Repealed] Repealed. ( Res. No. 2024-27 ; Res. No. 17-41 .) Prior Codifications \u00a7PAP.10.6.180 was formerly codified as XIV LCOTCL \u00a710.618", "num": "PAP.10.6.180", "path": "library|Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law|PAP|PAP.10|PAP.10.6|PAP.10.6.180", "title": "PAP.10.6.180 Memorandums of Understanding\n[Repealed]", "url": "/us/nsn/lco/council/code/PAP.10.6.180"}
