{"body": "Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law 2022 Edition Recodification Table This table shows the location of former Lac Courte Oreilles Tribal Code of Law sections within the 2021 Edition of the code. The 2022 recodification: \"renumbered\" titles with three letter acronyms, codified previously uncodified ordinances and codes, incorporated Chapters from Lac Courte Oreilles' Old Court Code into the new Code, standardized subsection numbering, and added cross-references. To find where a new chapter or section is located, type the old chapter name or number, or old section number into the box below. Old Section New Section II LCOTCL \u00a75.101 \u00a7TCT.1.1.010 II LCOTCL \u00a75.102 \u00a7TCT.1.1.020 II LCOTCL \u00a75.103 \u00a7TCT.1.1.030 II LCOTCL \u00a75.104 \u00a7TCT.1.1.040 II LCOTCL \u00a75.105 \u00a7TCT.1.1.050 II LCOTCL \u00a75.106 \u00a7TCT.1.1.060 II LCOTCL \u00a75.107 \u00a7TCT.1.1.070 II LCOTCL \u00a75.108 \u00a7TCT.1.1.080 II LCOTCL \u00a75.109 \u00a7TCT.1.1.090 II LCOTCL \u00a75.201 \u00a7TCT.1.2.010 II LCOTCL \u00a75.301 \u00a7TCT.1.3.010 II LCOTCL \u00a75.302 \u00a7TCT.1.3.020 II LCOTCL \u00a75.303 \u00a7TCT.1.3.030 II LCOTCL \u00a71.101 \u00a7TCT.2.1.010 II LCOTCL \u00a71.102 \u00a7TCT.2.1.020 II LCOTCL \u00a71.103 \u00a7TCT.2.1.030 II LCOTCL \u00a71.104 \u00a7TCT.2.1.040 II LCOTCL \u00a71.105 \u00a7TCT.2.1.050 II LCOTCL \u00a71.106 \u00a7TCT.2.1.060 II LCOTCL \u00a71.107 \u00a7TCT.2.1.070 II LCOTCL \u00a71.108 \u00a7TCT.2.1.080 II LCOTCL \u00a71.201 \u00a7TCT.2.2.010 II LCOTCL \u00a71.301 \u00a7TCT.2.3.010 II LCOTCL \u00a71.302 \u00a7TCT.2.3.020 II LCOTCL \u00a71.303 \u00a7TCT.2.3.030 II LCOTCL \u00a71.304 \u00a7TCT.2.3.040 II LCOTCL \u00a71.305 \u00a7TCT.2.3.050 II LCOTCL \u00a71.306 \u00a7TCT.2.3.060 II LCOTCL \u00a71.307 \u00a7TCT.2.3.070 II LCOTCL \u00a71.308 \u00a7TCT.2.3.080 II LCOTCL \u00a71.309 \u00a7TCT.2.3.090 II LCOTCL \u00a71.310 \u00a7TCT.2.3.100 II LCOTCL \u00a71.401 \u00a7TCT.2.4.010 II LCOTCL \u00a71.402 \u00a7TCT.2.4.020 II LC